## WATCH STREAMS

Add ?watch=true to any list endpoint to receive a streaming newline-delimited JSON feed:
  {"type": "ADDED"|"MODIFIED"|"DELETED"|"BOOKMARK", "object": {...}}

  curl -k -H "Authorization: Bearer {{K3S_TOKEN}}" \
    "https://{{K3S_HOST}}:6443/api/v1/namespaces/default/pods?watch=true"

To resume after disconnect, capture .metadata.resourceVersion from last event:
  ?watch=true&resourceVersion=<last_seen_rv>

Watch streams are ideal for AIANA event ingestion — watch /api/v1/events?fieldSelector=type=Warning
and deduplicate via Redis before creating alert PRs.

